<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss govt issues 6-mo claims to be paid Oct 31.</title>
<headline>Swiss govt issues 6-mo claims to be paid Oct 31.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing six-month money market claims to be paid for on October 31, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on October 29.</p>
<p>The previous issue of six-month claims, paid for on September 12, raised 850.40 million francs and was priced at 99.024 percent to yield 1.950 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
